OL,3,GNEWSAMP opposing data centre joins     
OL,4,Agovernment committee                   
OL,6,FAn MP who is opposing plans for a large
OL,7,Fdata centre has admitted the facilities
OL,8,Fare needed, but does not want one      
OL,9,Fproposed in his constituency built.    
OL,11,FBen Goldsborough, Labour MP for South  
OL,12,FNorfolk, has been appointed to a new   
OL,13,Fdata centre committee, which will      
OL,14,Fscrutinise the government's national   
OL,15,Fpolicies.                              
OL,17,FThe politician has been vocal in his   
OL,18,Fopposition to plans to build a 150     
OL,19,Fmegawatt (MW) facility in the village  
OL,20,Fof Keswick, near Norwich.              
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
